{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id24252870"}, "name":{"label":"Kindmd"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-08T16:43:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"484.0.0"}, "id":{"label":"14643826826"}, "title":{"label":"Gets worse with every update"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using Strava since 2010-ish and with every update it gets worse. Sure I don’t pay for the subscription because it’s ridiculously expensive. The app is not very stable, always has errors. And now there’s almost no point in having the app on my phone since it gives little information and has stripped everything away from the free version to force you to pay. Time for a new app! Bye Strava!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=426826309&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
